BT /F2 7.20 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.350 rg 40.00 745.89 Td (1. Visual Problem Detection: ) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.00 Tf 0.150 0.150 0.200 rg 40.00 745.89 Td (Student uploads photo/video. Vision model analyzes affected object, visible problem/damage, likely maintenance category, and supporting context) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.00 Tf 0.150 0.150 0.200 rg 40.00 737.39 Td (\(e.g. ceiling fan -> damaged; tube light -> non-functional\). Discloses lighting/angle quality limits.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.20 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.350 rg 40.00 719.89 Td (2. Room Scan Mode: ) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.00 Tf 0.150 0.150 0.200 rg 40.00 719.89 Td (Single wide classroom/lab photo surfaces multiple candidate issues in one pass \(e.g. Room 204: broken fan, damaged desk, flickering light\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.00 Tf 0.150 0.150 0.200 rg 40.00 711.39 Td (Student reviews and confirms before submission; no unconfirmed ticket spam.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.20 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.350 rg 40.00 693.89 Td (3. Evidence Extraction \(Optional OCR\): ) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.00 Tf 0.150 0.150 0.200 rg 40.00 693.89 Td (Where legible, OCR identifies room numbers, block signage, and asset tags. Absent or illegible text is simply skipped  -  no hallucinations.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.20 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.350 rg 40.00 676.39 Td (4. Duplicate Incident Detection: ) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.00 Tf 0.150 0.150 0.200 rg 40.00 676.39 Td (Compares new incidents against open tickets using location, category, semantic similarity, and visual similarity. Flags 'Possible duplicate) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.00 Tf 0.150 0.150 0.200 rg 40.00 667.89 Td (detected' to enable merging into existing incidents.) Tj ET
