Q
BT /F2 9.00 Tf 1.000 1.000 1.000 rg 40.50 799.39 Td (8) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.50 Tf 0.070 0.230 0.420 rg 58.00 798.89 Td (Judge Q&A Defense Sheet) Tj ET
q 0.07 0.23 0.42 RG 1 w
58.0 795.89 m 559.28 795.89 l S Q
BT /F2 6.60 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.350 rg 40.00 777.89 Td (Q: What if the AI incorrectly identifies a problem?) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.40 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 40.00 770.39 Td (A: CampusFix uses confidence thresholds and human-in-the-loop review. Low-confidence results are flagged for confirmation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 6.60 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.350 rg 40.00 758.89 Td (Q: What if students upload irrelevant images / selfies?) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.40 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 40.00 751.39 Td (A: An upfront vision filter checks campus infrastructure context. Irrelevant or suspicious submissions are rejected immediately.) Tj ET
BT /F2 6.60 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.350 rg 40.00 739.89 Td (Q: How does duplicate detection work?) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.40 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 40.00 732.39 Td (A: Combines location context, issue category, semantic similarity, and visual embedding similarity to detect matching open tickets.) Tj ET
BT /F2 6.60 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.350 rg 40.00 720.89 Td (Q: How do you know the repair actually happened?) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.40 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 40.00 713.39 Td (A: Staff must upload an after-repair photo. Multimodal Vision compares before vs after. Authorized staff make final closure.) Tj ET
BT /F2 6.60 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.350 rg 40.00 701.89 Td (Q: Can CampusFix integrate with an existing college ERP?) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.40 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 40.00 694.39 Td (A: Yes. The architecture exposes REST APIs and webhooks for ERP integration \(SAP, Peoplesoft\). MVP runs standalone.) Tj ET
BT /F2 6.60 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.350 rg 40.00 682.89 Td (Q: Can AI automatically decide urgency?) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.40 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 40.00 675.39 Td (A: AI suggests priority based on hazard detection \(e.g. exposed live wire\), but authorized staff confirm critical priorities.) Tj ET
BT /F2 6.60 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.350 rg 40.00 663.89 Td (Q: Do you need special hardware?) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.40 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 40.00 656.39 Td (A: No. Zero Capex. Operates on existing smartphones, tablets, and desktop web browsers.) Tj ET
BT /F2 6.60 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.350 rg 40.00 644.89 Td (Q: Is this just a ticketing system?) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.40 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 40.00 637.39 Td (A: No. Ticketing is only the workflow layer. The AI performs vision understanding, classification, deduplication, and verification.) Tj ET
BT /F2 6.60 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.350 rg 40.00 625.89 Td (Q: Do you need to train your own computer vision model?) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.40 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 40.00 618.39 Td (A: No. The prototype utilizes multimodal LLMs \(Gemini Vision\) zero-shot. Production can fine-tune on campus imagery.) Tj ET
BT /F2 6.60 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.350 rg 40.00 606.89 Td (Q: What if one photo contains multiple problems?) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.40 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 40.00 599.39 Td (A: Room Scan Mode detects multiple defects simultaneously and lets the user review and selectively log them.) Tj ET
